00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,440
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Joy was going to the petting zoo.

2
00:00:03,019 --> 00:00:04,380
She was excited.

3
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:07,840
It was going to be her first time

4
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:09,080
seeing animals.

5
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,840
When her dad parked the car, she opened

6
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:15,780
the car door right away.

7
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:19,680
Joy, wait for us, her dad said.

8
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:22,740
Once her mom and dad got out of

9
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:25,640
the car, Joy made them run to the

10
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:26,400
zoo with her.

11
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:28,020
They arrived.

12
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:30,100
Joy saw the animals.

13
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,820
Her smile disappeared.

14
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:35,820
The animals were not that impressive.

15
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:40,460
There were only rabbits, horses, and dogs.

16
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:42,860
They were very boring.

17
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:46,920
She was hoping to see more wild animals.

18
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:50,840
Let's go home, Joy said.

19
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:54,100
No way, we came all the way here

20
00:00:54,100 --> 00:00:56,860
to pet animals, her dad said.
